## Decisions

- Use a methodical, milestone-gated migration rather than treating this as a routine version bump.
- The real target is both the beneficiary and a qualification canary for the Windows installer.
- Repair genuine defects in the canonical installer/updater and release them; do not leave
  target-only workarounds behind.
- Execute OS-sensitive work on Windows and retain backups until the upgraded target is accepted.

